    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Test Module
    \list
      \li \l{TestCase}'s \l{TestCase::}{optional} property is deprecated in
          \l{Qt Quick Test}. Use \l{TestCase::}{skip()} instead.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D Module
    \list
      \li Added the \l{SkyMaterial} QML type for rendering a
          procedural sky and generating image-based lighting data.
      \li Added \l{QuadTextureProvider} to \l{QtQuick3D.Helpers} import.
          A QML type used to render a quad texture using a
          custom fragment shader.
      \li \l{Model} gained an \l{Model::}{instancingLodFactor} property for manual
          level-of-detail control when using GPU instancing.
      \li \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment} gained
          \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment::}{ssrThickness} and
          \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment::}{ssrMaxSteps} properties for finer control
          of screen-space reflections.
      \li \l{RuntimeLoader} gained \l{RuntimeLoader::}{query()} and
          \l{RuntimeLoader::}{queryAll()} methods for finding objects
          by name or type within a dynamically loaded scene.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D XR Module
    \list
      \li Added support for mono view configuration
          (\c XR_VIEW_CONFIGURATION_TYPE_PRIMARY_MONO), enabling Qt
          Quick 3D XR applications to run on 2D XR devices such as
          AR glasses.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D Physics Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick VectorImage Module
    \list
        \li Added \l{QtQuick.VectorImage::VectorImage::asynchronous}{asynchronous} property for
            loading vector image.
        \li Added \l{QtQuick.VectorImage::VectorImage::status}{status} property for tracking the
            progress of loading the image.
        \li Added \l{QtQuick.VectorImage::VectorImage::retainWhileLoading}{retainWhileLoading}
            to be used in combination with \c asynchronous.
        \li Added \l{QtQuick.VectorImage::VectorImage::generatedItem}{generatedItem} property for
            accessing the generated subtree.
    \endlist

