    \section2 Qt SVG Module
    \list
      \li Animated SVG files are now supported by \l{QMovie} and
          \l{AnimatedImage}.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Test Module
    \list
      \li Benchmark results now include variance and standard deviation
          across measurement backends (time, CPU ticks, events, Valgrind).
      \li The plain-text benchmark logger now formats floating-point
          results using scientific notation for consistency.
      \li When non-existent test functions are specified on the command
          line alongside valid ones, the valid tests are still executed.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt VirtualKeyboard Module
