    \section2 Qt Widgets Module
    \list
      \li \l{QTreeView} gained \l{QTreeView::itemDecorationRect()}, which
          returns the bounding rectangle of the decoration (icon) for a
          given index.
      \li \l{QStyle::StandardPixmap} gained
          \l{QStyle::SP_TabScrollLeftButton},
          \l{QStyle::SP_TabScrollRightButton},
          \l{QStyle::SP_TabScrollUpButton}, and
          \l{QStyle::SP_TabScrollDownButton} for tab bar scroll buttons.
      \li \l{QDialogButtonBox} gained \l{QDialogButtonBox::standardButtonText()}
          and \l{QDialogButtonBox::standardButtonShortcut()}, which return the
          text and the shortcut of a \l{QDialogButtonBox::StandardButton}
          respectively.
      \li On macOS, \l{QMainWindow}'s unified title and toolbar mode has
          been modernized to use effect views for background styling.
    \endlist

